Added per-`GoldenConfigSetting` enable flags (`enable_backup`, `enable_intended`, `enable_compliance`, `enable_plan`, `enable_deploy`, `enable_sotagg`, `enable_postprocessing`) so each feature can be toggled on a per-Setting basis. Each flag defaults on a new Setting to its previous app-level default (enabled, except `enable_postprocessing`), and a data migration copies the previous app-level `enable_*` values onto existing Settings.
Added filtering and bulk-editing of `GoldenConfigSetting` records by the new `enable_*` flags, and surfaced those flags on the Golden Config Setting detail view.
